      "spam": false,
      "value": "it does change to a different menu, that sizes with IPD.  I do wish there were more to be displayed at once, yes.  More filters, maybe sub-tabs so you can have all the tabs we do have, but each one displayed only if that tab is selected, so more on the screen at once!  Scroll down, instead of sideways.\n\nalso the current menu is a bit too sensitive to sliding (will often slide instead of select the avatar, making me have to click several times till it works), especially with a giant avatar, makes it hard to shrink back down.  so yea I could agree with a tweak to the menus would be nice.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
