  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2017-12-01T23:15:00.259Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The menu you hold in your hand is good and convenient. But the Worlds/Avatars/Social submenus could be more VR-friendly...\n\nScrolling sideways through a menu that displays only 4-5 entries just feels very \"small.\" I feel like Worlds/Avatars/Social would benefit a lot from being much wider, going around me in a ring with the 1st item being directly in front, and items fading in and out directly behind me as I scroll. \n\nMaybe some VR users would prefer that it only encompass 180 degrees in front of us instead of 360 degrees all around, but could definitely stand to be MUCH wider if the user is in VR mode.",
